Package: veetee
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: openssh-client
Description: DEC VT terminal emulator for OpenVMS and other DEC hosts
 veetee emulates DEC video terminals, from the VT52 and VT100 to the VT420 and
 the colour VT525, as faithfully as the manuals allow: DEC factory Set-Up
 defaults, fonts drawn on DEC's own character cells, and the control functions
 that forms and editing applications rely on.
 .
 It connects over Telnet, SSH, serial lines and local shells, with an LK401
 keyboard layout, the terminal's own Set-Up, saved connections, session logs,
 a searchable history and screen reader support.
 .
 vttest passes across the VT100-VT520 menus headless, and esctest2 runs at VT
 level 5 with every difference from xterm explained against a DEC manual.
